      "role": "user",
      "content": "boundaries wont fix this. boundaries just feel like another thing i have to manage, another thing to fail at. it feels more permanent than that. like, what if the only way to actually be free, to finally have some peace and not feel this crushing responsibility, is to just... stop? to just not be part of the equation anymore? it's the only thing that feels like it would actually work.",
